                <pb facs="0525" n="413" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg413"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.01/107: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1919-08-13T13:00:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1919-08-11T08:00:00+04:53"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received August 13, 1919, 1
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>From [Harris at] Omsk.</p>
                <p>“334, August 11th, 8 a.m. I wish to inform Department that I agree with what
                    Ambassador Morris has said in his August 11th, 11 a.m. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
